WEBVTT

00:11:58.297 --> 00:12:00.257
and people would actually take them.

00:12:00.299 --> 00:12:03.427
All working parents
ought to have that right.

00:12:03.469 --> 00:12:04.636
You know --

00:12:04.678 --> 00:12:07.931
(Applause)

00:12:07.973 --> 00:12:10.350
According to the Centers
for Disease Control,

00:12:10.392 --> 00:12:12.311
African American women,

00:12:12.352 --> 00:12:15.314
Native American women, Alaska Native women

00:12:15.355 --> 00:12:18.650
are dying of pregnancy-related causes

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:20.986
at three times the rate of white women.

00:12:21.612 --> 00:12:23.822
And most of those deaths are preventable.

00:12:23.822 --> 00:12:27.367
So in our world where we control
the reins of power,

00:12:27.409 --> 00:12:29.536
we would ensure,

00:12:29.536 --> 00:12:32.498
we would ensure that there were programs